[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0053","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0053.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0136","title":"ProFTPD 1.2.0rc2 内存泄漏拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ProFTPd 1.2.0rc2 存在内存泄漏漏洞，由于程序在处理 USER 命令时未能正确释放已分配的内存资源，远程攻击者可通过连续发送大量 USER 命令导致目标服务器内存耗尽，造成拒绝服务。若服务器安装配置不当，SIZE 命令也可能触发该问题。该漏洞影响 ProFTPd 1.2.0rc2 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，属于中危漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0136"],"sources":["exploitdb","cve"],"published":"2001-03-12","updated":"2026-07-22","remediation":"升级 ProFTPd 至 1.2.0 rc3 或更高正式版本，该内存泄漏问题已在后续版本中修复。如无法升级，可在配置文件中限制单 IP 并发连接数（MaxClientsPerHost）并启用速率限制（RateEngine）以降低攻击影响。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0122.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0132.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0267.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000380","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-029","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-021.php3","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/152206","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5801","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/241","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2001/CVE-2001-0136.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0136.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0136","https://github.com/OWASP/Nettacker/blob/09207f94b6b4410b25f65d64dc94fb7eb37ad77f/docs/Modules.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/18f30daec42a89fb944e240ef8177051f41351b8/data/2001/CVE-2001-0136.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-029.nasl","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0136.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f684-qh6c-rp3v/GHSA-f684-qh6c-rp3v.json","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-029.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0053.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0044","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0044.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0109","title":"SuSE Linux rctab 竞争条件漏洞","description":"SuSE Linux 6.x 及 7.0 系统中的 rctab 工具在处理临时文件 rctmp 时存在竞争条件漏洞。本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击方式，在 rctab 创建临时文件与写入文件之间的时间窗口内，将 rctmp 符号链接指向目标系统任意文件，从而以 rctab 进程权限创建或覆盖系统任意文件。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地账户权限，利用难度较低，可能导致敏感文件篡改或权限提升。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0109"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"2001-03-12","updated":"2026-06-16","remediation":"SuSE Linux 7.0 及更早版本受此漏洞影响，官方已不再提供安全更新。建议升级至 SUSE Linux Enterprise 或其后继发行版 openSUSE。若无法升级，可手动修改 /sbin/rctab 脚本：使用 mktemp 命令替代硬编码临时文件名，创建临时目录前检查是否已存在，并移除 rctab 的 setuid 权限以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0226.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-01/0272.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2207","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5945","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20555","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0109.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0109","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0109.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/99462b1672511a2817705398570cd388f155e617/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0109.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-q8rh-mh54-r97r/GHSA-q8rh-mh54-r97r.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0109.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--dc1a6ce4-7e6d-42a9-b204-4eb3ab01072a.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0044.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0215","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0215.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0036","title":"KTH Kerberos IV 任意文件写入漏洞","description":"KTH Kerberos IV 存在本地文件覆盖漏洞，由于程序在处理票据文件时未对符号链接进行充分校验，本地攻击者可通过创建指向系统关键文件的符号链接，诱使 Kerberos 服务将票据数据写入目标文件，从而实现任意文件覆盖。该漏洞攻击复杂度较高，需要本地访问权限，但成功利用可能导致系统文件被破坏或服务异常。受影响的版本包括 KTH Kerberos IV 系列，建议用户升级至修复版本或限制本地用户访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0036"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:32.023","remediation":"立即升级 KTH Kerberos IV 至 Red Hat 安全公告 RHSA-2001-025 中提供的修补版本，或应用官方发布的 symlink 漏洞补丁。由于 KTH Kerberos IV 已停止维护，建议迁移至 MIT Kerberos 或 Heimdal 等活跃维护的 Kerberos 实现，并确保票据文件存储目录（如 /tmp）启用 sticky 位（chmod +t /tmp）以防止本地 symlink 攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0093.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0105.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-025.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5754","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0036.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0036","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0036.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0036.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0b54eddb6b01c4a2bdae016ba668128b1a8b9336/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-wx56-xj4w-qc5p/GHSA-wx56-xj4w-qc5p.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0036.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--287246a4-b5a2-4dc8-8119-cd45dfcdfa2b.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/deshalit/async_prog/blob/2a58e64a10a9fe3859356f4b80fc7f40a4683d0c/08/app/startup_db.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0215.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0037","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0037.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0089","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5 远程文件读取漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.0 至 5.5 版本中存在文件读取漏洞。远程攻击者可构造特制 HTML 页面，利用 `<INPUT TYPE=FILE>` 表单元素强制客户端读取本地任意文件并提交至服务器。攻击者须诱使用户访问恶意网页，成功后可窃取目标系统上的敏感文件。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 2.6，危害等级低，影响 IE 5.0 至 5.5 版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0089"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:38.113","remediation":"立即升级到 Internet Explorer 6 或更高版本，此漏洞在 IE6 中已修复。如无法升级，可在浏览器安全设置中将「将文件上载到服务器时包含本地目录路径」设为禁用，或通过组策略限制 ActiveX 控件和表单自动提交行为作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-093","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5615","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20459","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0089.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0089","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0089.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/09ea4c6e198f67c97f9e843f2fc9dbea00a9ec98/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0089.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3pww-g69g-29xx/GHSA-3pww-g69g-29xx.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150600_150700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0089.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6923665c-e5fe-40bb-9aa6-5fa09bcc29b2.json","https://github.com/deshalit/async_prog/blob/2a58e64a10a9fe3859356f4b80fc7f40a4683d0c/08/app/startup_db.py"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0037.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0037.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0037.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0030","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0030.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0066","title":"GNU slocate 本地内存破坏漏洞","description":"Secure Locate（slocate）是一款用于文件索引和搜索的工具，其数据库文件解析功能存在缓冲区边界检查缺陷。本地攻击者可通过构造恶意的 slocate 数据库文件，在其中指定超出预期缓冲区范围的偏移值，导致内存越界访问，进而触发内存损坏。成功利用此漏洞的攻击者可获取 root 权限，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 slocate 2.0 及更早版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限以加载特制数据库文件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0066"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:35.530","remediation":"升级 slocate 至 2.0 及以上版本，该版本修复了数据库文件解析中的缓冲区边界检查缺陷。如无法升级，可改用 GNU findutils 自带的 locate 命令替代 slocate，或限制不可信用户对 slocate 数据库文件的写入权限，仅允许 root 用户更新数据库。MandrakeSoft 已发布 MDKSA-2000:085 安全公告，Debian 也已发布相应安全更新。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-11/0356.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000369","http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20001217a","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2000/MDKSA-2000-085.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-128.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2004","http://www.turbolinux.com/pipermail/tl-security-announce/2001-February/000144.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5594","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/216","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0066.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0066","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0066.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0066.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7007cbf91cfd56bead27c222fc520c733ed0ad71/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6v8c-3mh5-j3wq/GHSA-6v8c-3mh5-j3wq.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2000/20001217a.data","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2000-085.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3bda1b84-ec40-4e53-afb0-a9c88896a6be.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0030.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0026","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0026.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0052","title":"IBM DB2 Universal Database SQL 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"IBM DB2 Universal Database for Windows NT 6.1 及 7.1 版本存在 SQL 拒绝服务漏洞。攻击者可通过向数据库发送特制的畸形查询语句，触发该漏洞导致数据库服务崩溃或无法响应正常请求。该漏洞影响 IBM DB2 Universal Database for Windows NT 6.1 和 7.1 版本，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。攻击者在拥有数据库访问权限的情况下即可利用此漏洞发动拒绝服务攻击，无需高级权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0052"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:33.917","remediation":"升级 IBM DB2 Universal Database 至 V8 或更高版本，该漏洞已在后续版本修复。若无法立即升级，在应用层实施 SQL 输入白名单校验，禁止非管理员用户传递未经参数化的原始查询语句，同时在数据库网关层面限制单个连接的查询超时与最大执行时间，缓解 DoS 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/149207","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2067","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5664","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20470","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0052.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0052","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0052.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0052.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6q7f-6pgm-q59m/GHSA-6q7f-6pgm-q59m.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0052.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--e3b4d076-6485-475c-a62c-16b01935a5f2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0026.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0025","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0025.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0051","title":"IBM DB2 Universal Database 默认密码漏洞","description":"IBM DB2 Universal Database 6.1 存在默认口令漏洞，安装过程中会自动创建具有已知默认用户名和密码的数据库账户。远程攻击者可利用该默认账户直接登录数据库系统，无需身份认证即可获取数据库的完全控制权限，导致敏感数据泄露、数据篡改或服务中断。该漏洞影响 Linux 及 Windows NT 平台上的 IBM DB2 Universal Database 6.1 版本，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0051"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:33.807","remediation":"立即修改 DB2 默认账户（如 db2admin/db2admin）的密码为强密码，或删除不必要的默认账户；升级至 IBM DB2 V7 及以上版本，新版本已移除默认账户机制。同时限制数据库监听端口（默认 50000）仅对可信 IP 开放，并在防火墙层面对数据库端口实施访问控制白名单。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/149222","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2068","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5662","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20472","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0051.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0051","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0051.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f85df5a91c5446a7fcdf9094db67818508b32b7c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0051.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x2pj-7r2v-7334/GHSA-x2pj-7r2v-7334.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/account_db2as_db2as.nasl","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/account_db2as_ibmdb2.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/account_db2fenc1_ibmdb2.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0051.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2068/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0025.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0024","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0024.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0050","title":"BitchX IRC Client DNS缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"BitchX IRC 客户端在处理 DNS 反向解析时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当远程攻击者控制的服务器返回超长的主机名或域名时，BitchX 客户端在解析该 DNS 响应时未对数据进行充分边界检查，导致缓冲区溢出。攻击者可利用此漏洞造成客户端拒绝服务，甚至执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 BitchX 1.0 c17 及更早版本，无需身份认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。目前已存在公开的利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0050"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:33.680","remediation":"立即升级 BitchX 至 1.0 正式版或更高版本，该版本已修复 DNS 主机名解析缓冲区溢出问题。各发行版用户请安装对应补丁：FreeBSD 安装 FreeBSD-SA-00:78 安全公告更新，Red Hat Linux 应用 RHSA-2000-126 提供的 bitchx-1.0-1 更新包，Mandrake Linux 安装 MDKSA-2000-079 补丁。由于 BitchX 项目已停止维护，建议迁移至 irssi、WeeChat 或 HexChat 等仍在维护的 IRC 客户端。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0081.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0086.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000364","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2000/MDKSA-2000-079.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-126.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2087","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5701","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20490","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/58bdedd85e346c3efc30a2f8424c96c50aa4db2e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0050.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0050","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0050.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7b14132e5983d4643412f6d4f89beb409b809e9f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0050.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3b3e0c6dace1e53ea2fb8cc49db3e38b834c9179/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-25vv-55gh-jghh/GHSA-25vv-55gh-jghh.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2000-079.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0050.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2d460e07-88fd-4207-9368-f9d096a1602b.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0024.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0023","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0023.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0049","title":"WatchGuard SOHO Firewall 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"WatchGuard SOHO FireWall 2.2.1 及更早版本存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标设备发送大量 HTTP GET 请求导致防火墙服务崩溃或响应中断。该漏洞影响 WatchGuard SOHO 系列防火墙设备，攻击条件简单，无需特殊权限，攻击者可借此造成目标网络防护失效，属于中等危害漏洞。目前尚无官方补丁，建议升级到更高版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0049"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:33.570","remediation":"升级 WatchGuard SOHO Firewall 至 2.2.1 以上版本，该漏洞已在后续版本修复。如无法升级，可在防火墙上配置请求速率限制规则，对单一源 IP 的 HTTP GET 请求进行限速（如每秒不超过 100 个请求），同时在网络边界部署入侵检测系统拦截异常流量。由于该产品已停止维护，建议迁移至受支持的替代产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0079.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2082","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5665","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20487","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0049.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0049","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2001-0049.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0049.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9gmh-g2w2-5jwr/GHSA-9gmh-g2w2-5jwr.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0049.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json","https://github.com/Hepburnsunsir/poc-/blob/3303182f1e0caa3228cb2b3ce8cd9147b237c5b7/routersploit/routersploit/modules/exploits/routers/watchguard/CVE-2001-0049-pl.py","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0023.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0022","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0022.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0042","title":"Apache HTTP Server PHP 3.x 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Apache 1.3.6 与 PHP 3.x 组合中存在路径遍历文件泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含 \"%5c\"（URL 编码反斜杠）的变形目录遍历请求，绕过输入过滤机制，读取 Web 服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于 PHP 3.x 对编码后的路径分隔符处理不当，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可导致敏感配置文件或系统源代码泄露。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。Apache 与 PHP 官方已在后续版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0042"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:32.783","remediation":"将 Apache 升级至 1.3.9 或更高版本，并将 PHP 升级至 3.0.18 或 4.0.2 以上版本。同时配置 PHP 的 `doc_root` 和 `open_basedir` 限制访问范围，在 Apache 配置中禁用 `AllowEncodedSlashes On` 并对 `%5c` 等编码字符进行过滤。临时缓解措施可在 Web 应用防火墙或反向代理层拦截包含 `%5c` 的 URL 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/149210","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2060","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5659","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20466","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0042.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0042","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2001-0042.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0042.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gm7x-33x3-3qg9/GHSA-gm7x-33x3-3qg9.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/2001/0xxx/cve-2001-0042.yaml","https://github.com/NetBSD/pkgsrc-wip/blob/1e259307452fa6083f86403d8e77caee7006ff5d/sara/PLIST","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0042.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--90e53848-c2a1-44a9-bd63-0b9306167f77.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0022.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0021","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0021.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0041","title":"Cisco CatOS Telnet认证内存泄漏拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco Catalyst 4000/5000/6000 系列交换机 CatOS 存在内存泄漏漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过发送大量失败的 Telnet 认证请求耗尽设备内存，导致交换机拒绝服务甚至重启。该漏洞影响 CatOS 5.5.4a 及更早版本，利用方式简单，仅需重复发起 Telnet 连接并输入错误凭据即可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0041"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:32.620","remediation":"升级 Cisco Catalyst 交换机 CatOS 至 5.5(4b) 或更高版本（推荐 6.x 系列），以修复 Telnet 认证失败导致的内存泄漏问题。如无法升级，可在交换机上配置 ACL 限制 Telnet 访问源 IP，或改用 SSH 替代 Telnet 管理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/catalyst-memleak-pub.shtml","http://www.osvdb.org/801","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2072","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5656","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20473","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2001/CVE-2001-0041.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0041.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0041","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0041.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0041.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w3j9-383p-8723/GHSA-w3j9-383p-8723.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/CSCds66191.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--72200ab2-37b8-4bd8-a285-d14e4f17829c.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0021.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0020","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0020.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0040","title":"APC apcupsd 本地拒绝服务漏洞","description":"APC UPS 守护进程 apcupsd 存在本地拒绝服务漏洞。该程序将其进程 ID 写入一个全局可写的 PID 文件（apcupsd.pid），本地攻击者可通过修改该文件内容指定任意目标进程 ID，导致 apcupsd 进程终止时向该 PID 发送信号，进而造成系统其他进程被错误终止。该漏洞需本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0040"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:32.480","remediation":"升级 apcupsd 至 3.7.3 或更高版本，该版本已限制 PID 文件权限为仅 root 可写。如无法升级，手动执行 `chmod 644 /var/run/apcupsd.pid` 并修改启动脚本在 `start` 段添加 `umask 022`；同时创建专用系统账号（如 `apcupsd`）运行该守护进程，避免以 root 权限运行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0066.html","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-077.php3","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2070","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5654","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/251","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0040.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0040","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2001-0040.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0040.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-qp9g-233f-wxgh/GHSA-qp9g-233f-wxgh.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab