erberos IV 已停止维护且无安全更新，建议迁移至 MIT Kerberos 或 Heimdal：在 krb5.conf 中设置 allow_krb4=false 禁用 Kerberos 4 兼容模式，移除 krb4_proxy 环境变量支持，并将所有服务升级至 Kerberos 5 协议。临时缓解措施：通过 PAM 或系统安全策略限制不可信本地用户设置 krb4_proxy 变量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0093.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0105.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5733","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20491","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0034.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0034","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2001-0034.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0034.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-mq8w-3qcq-f5hf/GHSA-mq8w-3qcq-f5hf.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0034.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0ad56877-6fe2-4003-ad83-8cd3d98b1281.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0017.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0016","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0016.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0032","title":"ssldump 0.9b1 格式字符串漏洞","description":"ssldump 0.9 beta1 版本中存在格式字符串漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向受影响的 ssldump 服务发送包含恶意格式字符串说明符的特制 URL，利用该漏洞实现内存读取或写入操作，进而导致拒绝服务甚至获取 root 权限。该漏洞源于程序未对用户可控输入进行正确的格式化处理，允许攻击者在 printf 类函数中注入 %n、%s 等格式标记符，属于经典的格式串处理缺陷。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0032"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-02-16T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:31.567","remediation":"升级 ssldump 至 0.9b2 或更高版本，0.9b2 已修复格式字符串漏洞。如无法升级，可编译安装 https://github.com/adulau/ssldump 提供的最新维护版本，或限制仅信任来源使用 ssldump 解析 TLS 流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/149917","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2096","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5717","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20492","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/938c8c7c42ae0687cb1b4bbda0b614ab7a159527/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0032.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0032","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2001-0032.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6962d12e25fbf447fb7ec00c59de25f9ba4e2a94/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0032.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/60cf806ffc57d6909f887b4f3823ae39ed0d7c51/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gq3c-qhph-m92g/GHSA-gq3c-qhph-m92g.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0032.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_150500_150600.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c